                <invention-title lang="de">ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG UND VERFAHREN ZUR EXTRAKTION UND VERWENDUNG EINER SEMANTISCHEN ENTITÄT IN EINER TEXTNACHRICHT DER ELEKTRONISCHEN VORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE ET PROCÉDÉ POUR EXTRAIRE ET UTILISER UNE ENTITÉ SÉMANTIQUE DANS UN TEXTO D'UN DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ELECTRONIC DEVICE AND METHOD FOR EXTRACTING AND USING SEMANTIC ENTITY IN TEXT MESSAGE OF ELECTRONIC DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is a method of extracting and using a semantic entity from a text message by an electronic device. The method includes: transmitting or receiving a message; extracting a semantic entity from the message; storing the semantic entity in a database, wherein storing the semantic entity comprises storing a content and a type of semantic entity; executing an application and displaying an execution screen of the application, the execution screen including an input field; identifying a semantic setting content for the input field indicating a type of semantic entity for the input field; searching the database for semantic entities based on the identified semantic setting content; and providing at least one semantic entity from the searched semantic entities for the input field.</p>
            </abstract>
